  "description": "The meme uses the phrase 'hold my hookah pipe!' to imply that the Black woman is being 'held' or controlled by a male perspective, which is a form of racialized stereotype that suggests Black women are aggressive or violent. This stereotype is used to demean Black women and reinforce racial and gender-based discrimination. This is a form of racialized aggression stereotype that suggests Black women are only valuable if they are controlled or dominated by men.",
